There, that should do it.

60
00:03:47,060 --> 00:03:49,119
It's only a field dressing, though.

61
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:50,537
Looks good.

62
00:03:50,620 --> 00:03:54,897
thanks a ton damn you are

63
00:03:54,980 --> 00:03:59,537
a sizable woman I don't know

64
00:03:59,620 --> 00:04:04,837
compared to big mom she looks
pretty tiny I should have said

65
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:08,077
thank you for saving me earlier
from that sumo wrestlers

66
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:12,797
advances I didn't do anything

67
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:16,740
but look at him I suppose I

68
