82
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:13,080
I know you're as hungry as me!

83
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:14,440
All is well.

84
00:05:14,660 --> 00:05:15,497
You needn't be shy.

85
00:05:15,580 --> 00:05:21,520
But ma 'am, you already saved my life
and now you're offering me food? No!

86
