since she's had even a bite to eat?

114
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:53,420
That poor girl weaves
hats day in and day out.

115
00:07:53,700 --> 00:07:56,477
And if she's lucky, she'll
sell the whole batch,

116
00:07:56,560 --> 00:08:00,325
earning her just enough money to
barely get by and feed herself.

117
00:08:09,420 --> 00:08:11,780
It's even got little mochi balls in it.

118
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:14,522
This is the feast of a lifetime!

119
00:08:17,940 --> 00:08:21,764
Can't you pull those out of your
cheek whenever you want, though?

120
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:26,233
Yeah, but you can't fill your
tummy with the ones I make.

121
00:08:26,540 --> 00:08:27,440
No! No!

122
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:32,380
Hey, lady!

123
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:34,640
Thank you for being so kind to me!

124
00:08:37,500 --> 00:08:39,577
I've never had such a great birthday!

125
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:41,840
I don't think I can top it!

126
00:08:42,340 --> 00:08:45,458
A shame that Master isn't
here to share this with me!

127
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,070
Otsuru...

128
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:05,500
This is the greatest day of my life!

129
00:09:24,740 --> 00:09:27,820
