her all over this country.

130
00:09:28,900 --> 00:09:30,782
That's the state of things here.

131
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,660
That isn't right.

132
00:09:32,980 --> 00:09:35,460
That poor little kid. Always hungry.

133
00:09:37,100 --> 00:09:40,218
I mean, grown-ups are okay
because we can eat poison.

134
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,420
No, we can't.

135
00:09:41,620 --> 00:09:44,337
You've got the sea, rivers,
and forests, don't you?

136
00:09:44,420 --> 00:09:47,714
There's no reason people
should be starving around here.

137
00:09:48,260 --> 00:09:49,240
That's true.

138
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:53,320
If only we hadn't destroyed our own land.

139
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:58,520
Damn, Kaido!

140
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:00,930
Yeah.

141
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:09,617
you two are such kind-hearted
young men by the way what are

142
00:10:09,700 --> 00:10:13,517
your names you can call me Zoro

143
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:18,400
Judo I'm a ronin right I'm monkey

144
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:36,740
His name is, uh, Luffy Taro.

145
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,190
Huh?

146
00:10:39,273 --> 00:10:40,103
Oh, right.

147
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:44,300
I'm Luffy Taro.

148
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:47,390
Honorably.

149
00:10:51,020 --> 00:10:53,420
I know you're from overseas.

150
00:10:54,460 --> 00:10:56,931
I'm surprised that you could make it here.

151
00:10:57,020 --> 00:10:58,220
What gave us away?

152
