I hardly know where to start.

153
00:11:01,780 --> 00:11:02,977
No need to worry.

154
00:11:03,060 --> 00:11:05,180
I won't let your secret out.

155
00:11:06,940 --> 00:11:09,740
I haven't lived in this
town that long myself.

156
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:13,689
And Okiku has only been working
at my tea house for a month.

157
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:18,817
I heard the name of this
town means leftovers.

158
00:11:18,900 --> 00:11:20,429
What's the deal with that?

159
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:22,628
Just like the name implies.

160
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:25,560
The people here survive on scraps,

161
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:29,517
