Look over there.

164
00:11:37,300 --> 00:11:39,757
Do you see that tall
mountain in the middle?

165
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:42,134
Lush with foliage and without chimneys?

166
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:45,793
At its peak, there was once
a place known as Odin Castle.

167
00:11:45,940 --> 00:11:49,116
It's hard to believe so much
time has gone by already.

168
00:11:50,660 --> 00:11:51,490
Odin, huh?

169
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:53,357
Wait, I know that.

170
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:54,400
What is it?

171
00:11:55,500 --> 00:11:57,500
Until some 20 years ago,

172
00:11:57,800 --> 00:12:01,037
there was a group called
the Kozuki clan who had

173
