when he watched over this country.

176
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:18,280
His intent was to provide fresh,
healthy food to everyone in Kuri.

177
00:12:34,280 --> 00:12:36,400
You see how that's turned out.

178
00:12:36,820 --> 00:12:40,820
