hold everything under their thumb.

179
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:46,980
The Paradise Farm is beyond our reach.

180
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:50,600
I heard that.

181
00:12:51,020 --> 00:12:52,180
That food is safe?

182
00:12:52,980 --> 00:12:54,804
Not like the poison stuff here?

183
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:56,350
That's right.

184
00:12:57,360 --> 00:13:02,180
There's a bounty of crops and fresh
water, clothing, resources, and more.

185
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:04,557
But we can't so much as gaze upon them.

186
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:05,470
Not anymore.

187
00:13:06,020 --> 00:13:08,460
They belong to the Shogun Orochi.

188
00:13:11,680 --> 00:13:13,856
On the other side of the Shrine Gate,

189
00:13:13,940 --> 00:13:16,822
there is a town where all
of the officials dwell.

190
00:13:16,940 --> 00:13:17,770
Well,

191
00:13:17,853 --> 00:13:19,457
the people here live off
the scraps that they toss

192
00:13:19,540 --> 00:13:22,716
away and the nearly rotting
food that they sell to us.

193
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:27,376
Oh, that's why it's called leftovers.

194
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:31,540
Yes, Okobore, but at least we can live.

195
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:49,757
Oh, oh,

196
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:55,880
oh, oh.

197
