to Shogun, I'll know.

203
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:45,037
Regardless of what you might have heard.

204
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:48,297
There's no excuse to take
someone's life in cold blood.

205
00:14:48,380 --> 00:14:50,840
She would have died if that hit her.

206
00:14:52,920 --> 00:14:55,697
If people keep their mouths
shut then I won't have

207
00:14:55,780 --> 00:14:59,060
to shoot them probably
but if you want to rebel.

208
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:04,380
Well, that's one thing Lord Orochi
won't stand for no matter what.

209
00:15:39,420 --> 00:15:40,700
What the hell?

210
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:44,040
