212
00:15:46,580 --> 00:15:50,404
For a couple of weeks now, there
have been robberies at the farm.

213
00:15:50,820 --> 00:15:54,702
We've been looking everywhere for
the criminals without much luck.

214
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:55,960
Don't tell me.

215
00:15:56,220 --> 00:15:58,140
You're the bandits, aren't you?

216
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:06,140
A one-eyed ronin.

217
00:16:09,880 --> 00:16:12,660
You're the jerk I saw
on that Wanted poster.

218
00:16:15,060 --> 00:16:16,520
Hmm? Hmm?

219
00:16:28,540 --> 00:16:29,820
Stop it!

220
00:16:29,980 --> 00:16:30,820
Let me go!

221
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:33,560
What's your deal, weirdo?

222
00:16:34,100 --> 00:16:36,020
Where are you taking her?

223
00:16:37,460 --> 00:16:38,777
Someone help!

224
00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:41,260
Yes!

225
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:45,000
Taba!

226
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:47,680
Taba!

227
00:16:50,700 --> 00:16:53,020
Mission accomplished!

228
00:16:56,580 --> 00:16:59,340
You get back here!

229
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:14,960
Oh, Kiku!

230
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:24,320
A sword?

231
00:17:26,120 --> 00:17:28,260
He truly is fast.

232
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:30,500
I said let's dance!

233
00:17:31,140 --> 00:17:32,420
Shut up, you brat!

234
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:34,640
I don't give a crap! Mr.

235
00:17:34,780 --> 00:17:36,280
Lionbog, come aid me!

236
00:17:39,100 --> 00:17:39,930
Ah!

237
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,030
