238
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:52,440
That lady has a fancy sword on her.

239
00:17:52,620 --> 00:17:55,326
She did mention that she
knows how to use one.

240
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:58,160
Though I've never seen her fight.

241
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:03,160
Hey doggy!

242
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:05,480
