243
00:18:09,460 --> 00:18:10,360
Oh, my!

244
00:18:12,760 --> 00:18:13,590
Wait!

245
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:15,780
I'm coming, too.

246
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:17,430
Fine!

247
00:18:20,800 --> 00:18:22,640
Are you kidding me?

248
00:18:26,220 --> 00:18:27,637
Lusitaro, thank goodness.

249
00:18:27,720 --> 00:18:28,920
