from that kid, anyway?

251
00:18:34,560 --> 00:18:37,660
I'm not certain, but we had
better save her quickly.

252
00:18:38,860 --> 00:18:39,690
Huh?

253
00:18:40,280 --> 00:18:41,110
Tama!

254
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:43,880
