257
00:18:55,020 --> 00:18:56,040
Just keep going.

258
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:57,320
Thank you!

259
00:19:02,740 --> 00:19:04,700
So long, losers!

260
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:11,877
They pulled that off too easily;

261
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:15,497
