order of a headliner, no doubt though.

262
00:19:15,580 --> 00:19:20,740
I know not why, sadly, there's only
one destination in that direction.

263
00:19:22,220 --> 00:19:24,573
They're headed to the town of officials.

264
00:19:26,840 --> 00:19:27,670
What's that?

265
00:19:27,753 --> 00:19:30,677
There are three headliners
that dwell in that town,

266
00:19:30,760 --> 00:19:37,340
hawkins hold 'em and speed.

267
00:19:38,280 --> 00:19:39,110
Indeed.

268
00:19:39,193 --> 00:19:40,023
But that's not all.

269
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:43,217
There are also about 30
soldiers who acquired

270
00:19:43,300 --> 00:19:46,320
special abilities from
strange artificial fruits.

271
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:49,200
What is this?

272
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:52,539
You're more than just a
normal waitress, aren't you?

273
00:19:54,520 --> 00:19:55,820
Start talking.

274
00:20:02,840 --> 00:20:03,920
Hearken well.

275
00:20:05,460 --> 00:20:07,120
I am Samurai.

276
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:15,357
Hey, Master Hold 'em.

277
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:16,977
This is Gazelle Man here.

278
00:20:17,060 --> 00:20:19,277
I caught that little brat.

279
00:20:19,360 --> 00:20:20,217
You know?

280
00:20:20,300 --> 00:20:23,080
The one who tamed the
baboon off by the shore.

281
00:20:24,700 --> 00:20:27,280
Someone help me, please!

282
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,660
Excellent work.

283
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:33,160
We'll put her to good use.

284
00:20:34,140 --> 00:20:35,500
Bring her to me.

285
00:20:36,040 --> 00:20:36,880
Yes, sir!

286
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:53,620
Big Crow, hurry!

287
00:20:54,080 --> 00:20:55,140
Save me!

288
00:20:58,440 --> 00:20:59,600
In Kuri,

289
00:20:59,860 --> 00:21:01,797
there lies a place known as Bacala Town,

290
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:05,233
where pirates and officials
flourish while others starve.

291
00:21:14,460 --> 00:21:16,200
That damn rodent!

292
00:21:17,980 --> 00:21:20,260
Who does he think he is?

293
00:21:20,560 --> 00:21:23,920
The powerful aura of his
gave me pause for a moment.

294
00:21:24,060 --> 00:21:26,360
But I'm not giving up on Okiku.

295
00:21:26,600 --> 00:21:29,480
She will be my bride someday, Pin.

296
00:21:30,200 --> 00:21:35,220
I've got status, I've got fame, and
I've got a safe supply of food to eat.

297
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:39,780
Who could possibly reject
a man like me, Pit?

298
00:21:44,820 --> 00:21:48,240
You gotta stop sweating the
small stuff, you dumb lug.

299
00:21:49,560 --> 00:21:52,540
That gal you fancy's from Okobure Town.

300
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:57,762
They're so low-class that Lord Orochi won't
even accept them as servants, remember?

301
00:21:58,020 --> 00:22:00,440
Choo-choo-choo-choo!

302
00:22:01,080 --> 00:22:04,397
You're getting hung up on her
feelings when they don't matter.

303
00:22:04,480 --> 00:22:07,340
You can just force her to marry you.

304
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:10,880
Burn her house down so
she has nowhere to go.

305
00:22:11,240 --> 00:22:13,887
Kill her family so she
has no one to turn to.

306
00:22:14,140 --> 00:22:16,640
Make her completely dependent on you.

307
00:22:16,800 --> 00:22:19,800
When she's starving with
nothing left in the world,

308
00:22:19,920 --> 00:22:21,861
she'll change her tune real fast.

309
00:22:22,400 --> 00:22:24,920
Choo, choo, choo, choo, choo.

310
00:22:25,040 --> 00:22:26,980
You belong to the warrior class.

311
00:22:27,520 --> 00:22:32,108
That distinction means everything in the
land of Wano, so don't be a pushover.

312
00:22:32,540 --> 00:22:33,370
Huh?

313
00:22:37,520 --> 00:22:39,960
You're the star of our national sport,

314
00:22:40,120 --> 00:22:42,697
but you're bowing down
to the whims of a winch.

315
00:22:42,780 --> 00:22:44,200
Show some pride.

316
00:22:44,420 --> 00:22:46,340
It sets a bad example.

317
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:51,060
That's a fine point.

318
00:22:52,580 --> 00:22:53,620
You're right.

319
00:22:53,820 --> 00:22:56,660
I can do whatever I want with Okiku.

320
00:23:00,300 --> 00:23:01,480
What's the matter?

321
00:23:01,780 --> 00:23:04,300
Was the food not to your liking, sir?

322
00:23:08,280 --> 00:23:10,980
Is that a raccoon dog there?

323
00:23:11,380 --> 00:23:13,240
Yes, it's our pet.

324
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:14,980
We raised it ourselves.

325
00:23:15,540 --> 00:23:17,660
Why don't you cook it up for me?

326
00:23:20,460 --> 00:23:23,060
Raccoon dog is my favorite food.

327
00:23:49,160 --> 00:23:51,840
You're finally here.

328
00:24:06,820 --> 00:24:08,540
Keep going straight ahead.

329
00:24:12,640 --> 00:24:14,317
We'll charge through the front.

330
00:24:14,400 --> 00:24:16,137
Lifitaro, Zorojuro.

331
00:24:16,220 --> 00:24:17,057
Be ready.

332
00:24:17,140 --> 00:24:19,457
Beyond that gate is Bekori town.

333
00:24:19,540 --> 00:24:21,397
Where officials and pirates reign.

334
00:24:21,480 --> 00:24:23,800
We enter at our own peril.

335
00:24:28,620 --> 00:24:31,560
Now steal thine hearts. You ready?

336
00:24:32,480 --> 00:24:33,360
Always.

337
00:24:37,700 --> 00:24:39,880
You're a tiny little thing.

338
00:24:41,660 --> 00:24:43,840
I almost pity you.

339
00:24:44,300 --> 00:24:46,580
Go ahead and cry if you like.

340
00:24:50,740 --> 00:24:53,540
I'm not gonna cry, you Moon!

341
00:24:56,660 --> 00:24:57,490
Huh?

342
00:24:58,760 --> 00:25:00,660
You trying to act tough?

343
00:25:07,200 --> 00:25:08,040
Ow!

344
00:25:23,500 --> 00:25:25,660
I got a stitch in my side!

345
00:25:26,660 --> 00:25:27,490
I...

346
00:25:29,800 --> 00:25:30,920
Shut up!

347
00:25:31,620 --> 00:25:33,280
Get outta here! Link!

348
00:25:41,440 --> 00:25:42,760
Did you hear me?

349
00:25:42,960 --> 00:25:45,420
Go huff 'n puff somewhere else, would ya?

350
00:25:53,040 --> 00:25:55,137
You're supposed to be a runner, right?

351
00:25:55,220 --> 00:25:56,740
Work on your stamina.

352
00:26:04,040 --> 00:26:07,397
You moron, I wasn't talking to you.

353
00:26:07,480 --> 00:26:10,460
What don't give me that look?

354
00:26:30,740 --> 00:26:32,320
I'm scared!

355
00:26:33,860 --> 00:26:36,560
Why does he have a lie in there?

356
00:26:42,580 --> 00:26:43,980
Wanna fight?

357
00:26:44,240 --> 00:26:46,122
Haven't learned your lesson yet!

358
00:27:01,540 --> 00:27:03,040
What did he just do?

359
00:27:03,640 --> 00:27:04,470
Savage.

360
00:27:04,553 --> 00:27:07,028
That lion always goes
straight for the ball.

361
00:27:11,040 --> 00:27:12,020
Too bad.

362
00:27:12,440 --> 00:27:14,264
Since they share the same body,

363
00:27:14,420 --> 00:27:17,655
it's like the lion is hitting
itself in the balls, too.

364
00:27:18,080 --> 00:27:19,120
It's poetic.

365
00:27:23,280 --> 00:27:28,857
you think you would learn so
this girl here what should we do

366
00:27:28,940 --> 00:27:35,100
with her master holden are you
listening so your name's otama

367
00:27:40,320 --> 00:27:45,540
well you're clearly weak
and a little coward to boot

368
00:27:47,380 --> 00:27:50,640
And yet you tamed that savage baboon!

369
00:27:50,900 --> 00:27:52,060
How'd you do it?

370
00:27:52,340 --> 00:27:54,500
My men saw it happen!

371
00:28:14,200 --> 00:28:17,777
it's too late to play dumb with me we know

372
00:28:17,860 --> 00:28:21,020
it's a Devil Fruit power
but how does it work

373
00:28:24,760 --> 00:28:26,360
Come on, Runt.

374
00:28:26,760 --> 00:28:27,920
Spit it out!

375
00:28:31,680 --> 00:28:32,900
Listen, Otama.

376
00:28:33,200 --> 00:28:37,357
Your unique Devil Fruit ability will
no doubt be enticing to our enemies.

377
00:28:37,440 --> 00:28:41,028
If you use it in front of others,
I fear they may target you.

378
00:28:52,760 --> 00:28:55,120
All right, I'll tell you.

379
00:28:56,920 --> 00:29:02,917
The truth about me is that
I'm real popular with animals.

380
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:04,060
I don't know why.

381
00:29:05,880 --> 00:29:06,710
Aww.

382
00:29:08,060 --> 00:29:09,840
That is so cute.

383
00:29:10,400 --> 00:29:13,000
And here I thought you had secret powers.

384
00:29:15,420 --> 00:29:16,250
No.

385
00:29:16,333 --> 00:29:17,540
No powers here.

386
00:29:19,000 --> 00:29:21,100
You take me for a fool?

387
00:29:23,740 --> 00:29:26,580
I'm not screwing around here!

388
00:29:29,880 --> 00:29:31,360
Is it your cheek?

389
00:29:31,680 --> 00:29:32,974
That's what they said.

390
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:35,560
They saw you tear off a piece of it.

391
00:29:49,340 --> 00:29:51,920
If you're not gonna tell me, that's fine.

392
00:29:55,060 --> 00:29:56,980
Let's just try it.

393
00:29:57,580 --> 00:29:58,410
Hey!

394
00:29:58,493 --> 00:30:00,640
Bring me some pliers! Yes, sir!

395
00:30:05,160 --> 00:30:06,880
Not the little ones!

396
00:30:07,020 --> 00:30:08,580
The big scary pair!

397
00:30:12,420 --> 00:30:15,520
Are you there, Big Barrel?

398
00:30:28,340 --> 00:30:33,080
Help me, Big Barrel!

399
00:30:36,460 --> 00:30:38,500
I'm coming, come on!

400
00:30:43,860 --> 00:30:45,540
Turn back, you fools!

401
00:30:45,940 --> 00:30:47,880
Only death awaits you here!

402
00:30:48,220 --> 00:30:49,400
Don't hold back!

403
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:52,802
If we can just get past
them, we'll have made it!

404
00:30:52,920 --> 00:30:55,777
Luffy, we don't have time
to waste on these chumps.

405
00:30:55,860 --> 00:30:56,690
Push through!

406
00:30:57,180 --> 00:30:58,560
Feed me to it!

407
00:30:59,100 --> 00:31:01,320
Come on, dog! Charge!

408
00:31:06,280 --> 00:31:09,797
Oh no, captain!

409
00:31:09,880 --> 00:31:13,400
There's an emergency.

410
00:31:17,560 --> 00:31:21,997
Do something—you're gonna have to
explain the problem to me first.

411
00:31:22,080 --> 00:31:22,910
So

412
00:31:26,760 --> 00:31:30,577
Straw Hat finally made it to
wanna—that's good—what's the issue?

413
00:31:30,660 --> 00:31:35,520
what's the issue He and Roronoa are
charging straight into Baccona Town,

414
00:31:35,700 --> 00:31:36,780
ready for a fight!

415
00:31:38,340 --> 00:31:39,640
Bunch of fools!

416
00:31:39,940 --> 00:31:42,277
They're going to ruin the whole damn plan!

417
00:31:42,360 --> 00:31:43,840
So it would appear.

418
00:31:45,700 --> 00:31:46,780
What now?

419
00:31:49,580 --> 00:31:50,410
Captain!

420
00:31:53,260 --> 00:31:55,960
Let's go stop them and make it quick!

421
00:31:56,660 --> 00:31:57,800
Go on, Captain!

422
00:32:11,460 --> 00:32:15,340
If you want me to stop then
show me that ability of yours

423
00:32:36,580 --> 00:32:37,800
Dome!

424
00:32:54,080 --> 00:32:54,910
Huh?

425
00:32:54,993 --> 00:32:56,980
How did you do that?

426
00:32:58,640 --> 00:32:59,860
Dock!

427
00:33:00,200 --> 00:33:01,200
Dock?

428
00:33:02,280 --> 00:33:04,221
Conqueror's Haki, they call it!
